[[:db/add "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c" :answer/id #uuid "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c"] [:db/add "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/id #uuid "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75"] [:db/add "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/choices "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c"] [:db/add "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/correct "360ad401-2874-5fc0-8ed9-b0cf4c65167c"] [:db/ensure "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3" :answer/id #uuid "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3"] [:db/add "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/id #uuid "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751"] [:db/add "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/choices "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3"] [:db/add "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/correct "ce7d73fb-48b9-52e0-8db5-ee3ec33734a3"] [:db/ensure "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/id #uuid "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9"] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=-4\\sqrt{x}+3x+2$ at the point with $x$-coordinate $1$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/worked-solution "First find the point on the curve.\n\n$$\nf(1)=-4\\sqrt{(1)}+3(1)+2=1.\n$$\n\nThe normal passes through $(1,1)$.\n\nRewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=- 4 x^{\\frac{1}{2}} + 3 x + 2, \\\\f'(x)&=3 - \\frac{2}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}=3 - \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(1)&=3 - \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{(1)}}=1, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(1)}=-1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(1,1)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(1)&=-1(x-(1)), \\\\y&=- x + 2.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=-1x+(2), \\\\x&=2.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(2,0)$."] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/answer-fields "f5d5983f-10e9-532a-ad72-d6d6f3f4fb75"] [:db/add "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/answer-fields "97a1c6f5-e2fd-5e8b-8595-2adc77f79751"] [:db/ensure "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "cdd2a20d-8d5c-5e49-82a4-60608d28d3c9"] [:db/add "421bfe0d-57fe-5983-9da0-d05d659896c1" :answer/id #uuid "421bfe0d-57fe-5983-9da0-d05d659896c1"] [:db/add "421bfe0d-57fe-5983-9da0-d05d659896c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "421bfe0d-57fe-5983-9da0-d05d659896c1" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "421bfe0d-57fe-5983-9da0-d05d659896c1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "25dc6060-26fb-542d-afc0-849db5051640" :answer-field/id #uuid "25dc6060-26fb-542d-afc0-849db5051640"] [:db/add "25dc6060-26fb-542d-afc0-849